[statement]
Placing a package triggers, name by name, the packages whose conditions
each of its names completes: its own name first, then each name it
provides in the order stated, each name's packages in the order of apk's
table. `base` triggers `a` (bucket 12,779) and `b` (18,296), then `v`
triggers `c` (7,966), then `w` triggers `x` (2,196).

[repository]
P:base
V:1
p:v w

P:a
V:1
i:base

P:b
V:1
i:base

P:c
V:1
i:v

P:x
V:1
i:w

[request]
base

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install base 1
install a 1
install b 1
install c 1
install x 1
